    [Test] switches the Qwen3-30B-QuaRot-eagle3 from eager mode to FULL_DECODE_ONLY graph mode (#18023)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates the Qwen3-30B-QuaRot-eagle3 test case to use
    FULL_DECODE_ONLY graph mode instead of eager mode, with performance
    guard maintained.
    
    Changes in this PR:
    - Remove `--enforce-eager` from server_cmd to disable eager execution.
    - Add `--compilation-config '{"cudagraph_mode": "FULL_DECODE_ONLY"}'` to
    enable graph mode. Under this config, only the decode phase uses full
    ACL graph compilation; prefill phase remains eager.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This PR only changes test case, no API / CLI / behavior changes for
    end users.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    CI passed. Manual verification on Ascend 950 server:
    1. Launch vLLM engine with target model.
    2. Execute batch inference with long sequence inputs.
    3. Verify no crash and correct generation outputs.
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    Signed-off-by: lizhen <lizhen236@huawei.com>
    Co-authored-by: lizhen <lizhen236@huawei.com>

